                <formatted-text>
                  <run>This dashboard can be used to deep dive in to Entity level metrics. Select the metrics you would like to see from the &quot;Entity Level Metrics&quot; filter.

It should be kept in mind when checking the Monthly development that in some months there are more campaigns and vendors.</run>
                </formatted-text>
