              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8471' id='7' type-v2='text' w='84604' x='615' y='471'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>GMV incrementality calculated here is an abstract value not representing exact incrementality in the campaings.

On vendor and campaign level:
</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Campaign GMV Incr %:  </run>
                  <run>Last 7 days before campaign daily GMV average </run>
                  <run bold='true'>vs</run>
                  <run> During Campaign Daily GMV average
</run>
                  <run bold='true'>After Glow GMV Incr %:</run>
                  <run>Æ  </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Æ </run>
                  <run>Last 7 days before campaign GMV average </run>
                  <run bold='true'>vs</run>
                  <run> Next 7 days after Campaign GMV average

It should be kept in mind that some campaings don&apos;t have 7 days a part, so the following campaign would be including the previous campaign&apos;s increased GMV as base line.
Also, non-finished campaigns are being excluded in this view, since it is not possible to calculate the after glow effect.
</run>
                </formatted-text>
