    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Summary Dashboard'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/VendorMarkupBehavior/SummaryDashboard?rev=' id='SummaryDashboard' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/VendorMarkupBehavior' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1700' maxwidth='1300' minheight='1700' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <datasources>
        <datasource caption='all data ' name='federated.0l7vxjt1yx3rai1gyhpit1xcg88d' />
      </datasources>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0l7vxjt1yx3rai1gyhpit1xcg88d'>
        <column datatype='date' name='[campaign_start_month]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
        <column datatype='string' name='[country_code]' role='dimension' semantic-role='[Country].[ISO3166_2]' type='nominal' />
        <column datatype='string' name='[global_entity_id]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
        <column-instance column='[country_code]' derivation='None' name='[none:country_code:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
        <column-instance column='[global_entity_id]' derivation='None' name='[none:global_entity_id:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
        <column-instance column='[product_or_vendor_camp]' derivation='None' name='[none:product_or_vendor_camp:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
        <column-instance column='[region_segment]' derivation='None' name='[none:region_segment:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
        <column datatype='string' name='[product_or_vendor_camp]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
          <aliases>
            <alias key='%null%' value='No Campaign-Price Change' />
            <alias key='&quot;product_spesific_camp&quot;' value='Product Specific Campaigns' />
            <alias key='&quot;vendor_camp&quot;' value='Full Menu Campaigns' />
          </aliases>
        </column>
        <column datatype='string' name='[region_segment]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
        <column-instance column='[campaign_start_month]' derivation='Year' name='[yr:campaign_start_month:ok]' pivot='key' type='ordinal' />
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='99058' id='9' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98770' x='615' y='471'>
            <zone h='99058' id='48' is-fixed='true' type-v2='layout-basic' w='85308' x='615' y='471'>
              <zone h='9941' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='85308' x='615' y='471'>
                <zone fixed-size='184' forceUpdate='true' h='9941' id='5' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='85308' x='615' y='471'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>This dashboard </run>
                    <run underline='true'>ONLY</run>
                    <run> focuses on the Markup behavior of </run>
                    <run bold='true'>100% vendor funded campaigns</run>
                    <run>. The analysis was conducted based on the product price changes close to each individual campaign timeframe.  Please exclude &quot;No Campaign-Price Change&quot; vendors to see the relevant share values%.
Following behaviors of vendors were analyzed: 
1- </run>
                    <run bold='true'>Increasing</run>
                    <run> the prices of a </run>
                    <run bold='true'>product</run>
                    <run> before and </run>
                    <run bold='true'>decreasing</run>
                    <run> it after a </run>
                    <run bold='true'>campaign</run>
                    <run>&#10;2- </run>
                    <run bold='true'>Inreasing</run>
                    <run> prices of a </run>
                    <run bold='true'>product</run>
                    <run> before a </run>
                    <run bold='true'>campaign</run>
                    <run>&#10;3- </run>
                    <run bold='true'>Decreasing</run>
                    <run> prices of a </run>
                    <run bold='true'>product</run>
                    <run> after a </run>
                    <run bold='true'>campaign</run>
                    <run>

In order to take out the unsyncronized inflation effect countries face, this project mostly focuses on 1st type behavior.
Deciding KPI on big-picture view was selected as number of vendors. 
</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone h='89117' id='49' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='85308' x='615' y='10412'>
                <zone h='89117' id='6' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='85308' x='615' y='10412'>
                  <zone h='21431' id='18' name='Summary: Behaviors by Global Entities' w='85308' x='615' y='10412'>
                    <layout-cache minheight='223' type-h='scalable' type-w='cell' />
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
