                <zone h='5471' id='47' type-v2='text' w='85308' x='615' y='72627'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Similarity</run>
                    <run>: In order to understand the correlating effect between the price markup % and discount amount%, the analysis below checks if there is a 20% similarity in the price increase before the campaign and price decrease after the campaign. The dark red vendors had at least one campaign-product pair which they increased the price %20 similar to the discount offered and also decreased the price in 20%similarity. 

The </run>
                    <run bold='true'>similarity methodology</run>
                    <run> checks if </run>
                    <run bold='true'>[price change %]</run>
                    <run> is between </run>
                    <run bold='true'>lower threshold</run>
                    <run> [discount%]*[1-20%] and</run>
                    <run bold='true'> upper threshold</run>
                    <run> ([discount%]/[1-discount%])*[1+20%]</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='21431' id='20' is-fixed='true' name='Price Change Similarity with Campaign Discount for Bad Behavior 1' w='85308' x='615' y='78098'>
                  <layout-cache minheight='223' type-h='scalable' type-w='cell' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='5059' id='24' name='Price Change Similarity with Campaign Discount for Bad Behavior 1' pane-specification-id='0' param='[federated.0l7vxjt1yx3rai1gyhpit1xcg88d].[none:Calculation_3845792664720105483:nk]' type-v2='color' w='13462' x='85923' y='79588'>
